From: EdgePi E87N firmware build <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rust: disable ephemeral CI LLVM downloads

Rust stable source builds retain their source tarballs longer than their CI LLVM
artifacts. Once those artifacts are pruned, download-ci-llvm fails with HTTP 404.
Build LLVM from the pinned Rust source instead so the firmware build remains
reproducible after the temporary CI artifacts expire.
---
 feeds/packages/lang/rust/Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/feeds/packages/lang/rust/Makefile b/feeds/packages/lang/rust/Makefile
--- a/feeds/packages/lang/rust/Makefile
+++ b/feeds/packages/lang/rust/Makefile
@@ -79 +79 @@
-	--set=llvm.download-ci-llvm=true \
+	--set=llvm.download-ci-llvm=false \
